2782 Can you test on the same devices you tested https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87352 with? I have a feeling that the workaround from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87352 is no longer needed anymore after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106267\n\nI looked into this a bit and it looks like the `flip_xy_workaround` functions correctly, which must mean that the Adreno 3xx devices aren't wrongly rotated anymore and thus don't need to be flipped. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117552003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3118055584","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108817#issuecomment-3118055584","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108817","id":3118055584,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc652cCg","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":f